<title>AUSTRALIA: Horse Racing-Cummings accepts Japan Cup invitation for Saintly.</title>
<headline>Horse Racing-Cummings accepts Japan Cup invitation for Saintly.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trainer Bart Cummings said on Monday he had accepted an invitation for Cox Plate winner Saintly to run in next month's lucrative Japan Cup.</p>
<p>Saintly, who beat Filante in a photo-finish at Moonee Valley on Saturday, will leave for Japan after he runs in next Tuesday's Melbourne Cup classic at Flemington.</p>
<p>The Japan Cup will be run in Tokyo on November 24.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
